A NOTE ON THE DATA, WHICH MATTERS MORE THAN THE LICENCE
===========================================================================

The corpus is synthetic. Every person, name, crime number, address and phone
number in it was generated by data/generator from seed 4471. It contains no
real person and no real case.

It models the Karnataka State Police FIR schema and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or derived from any record held by the Karnataka State Police.

Do not use it as though it were real. It is a measuring instrument, built so
that identity resolution can be scored against a ground truth that real records
do not carry. Its difficulty parameters were chosen by us and are documented in
docs/decisions.md, which is the first thing to read before quoting any figure
from it.
